\ A runtime definition landing on a same-scope import. The collision sits inside a word body
\ called from top level, so it fires while the file runs rather than at parse time, and an AOT
\ build of this file reaches it at binary runtime instead of during the freeze.
\
\ The bare call is the file's last statement, so the raise stays in tail position on every tier.
\ No caller frame row forks the rendering. A configuration that accepts the overwrite in silence
\ shows as exit 0 with an empty stderr.

use "def_over_import_mod.1z" ;

taken .

clash-import: ( -- ) [ taken: ( -- n ) [ 1 ] ; ] ;

clash-import
